  unitName: Cyber Wings Exgear
  unitId: 50745
  unitNumber: 991
  description: A mechanical puppet from Ishgria made by a scientist from another
    world. Regardless of being unable to find one of the ancient Six Armors, Exgear
    continued to evolve. During this process, the scientist who had created Exgear
    began to zero in on the many abilities the demons of the land possessed, and
    used that knowledge to help Exgear evolve even further. Though the puppet only
    gained a slight amount of the demons' destructive power, it did begin to develop
    a will of its own. It is said that once the scientist realized this, he was overcome
    with joy.
  summonDesc: I have no records of losses.<br>I was programmed to always win.<br>There
    is no cause for alarm.
  fusionDesc: More fusion is needed<br>to ensure even better functionality.<br>Further
    evolution is required.
  evoDesc: All requirements for fusion<br>have been satisfied and exceeded.<br>Evolution
    complete.
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
